# VHS recording for the vertical Linear gallery
Output examples/vhs/generated/linear-vertical.gif

Set Theme "Aardvark Blue"
Set Width 749
Set Height 324
Set Padding 30
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type "target/release/examples/readme linear-vertical"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Classic/
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot target/vhs/linear-vertical.png
Sleep 2320ms
